message: "If you use or build on this design, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "WaterWalker"
abstract: "Four-wheel walk-inside water carrier. The user walks between large wheels, rollator style, pushing through a hip bar, while a low padded cradle holds four 20 L jerrycans or two clay pots between the axles. Mounting points for a later push-sensing hub motor assist for sand and slopes."
